  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nTODAY\nToday\nOrders\nBilling / Invoices\nPayments & Split\nRegister shifts & cash\nKITCHEN\nKitchen progress\nKitchen tickets\nMENU\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nInventory & Recipes\nPurchasing & Stock Control\nTABLES\nFloor / Tables\nReservations\nQR Table Ordering\nON\nGUESTS & TEAM\nCustomers & loyalty\nTeam & permissions\nREPORTS\nReports & Analytics\nActivity history\nDEVICES\nPrinters & Devices\nConnections & sync\nApp Downloads\nSETUP\nReceipt & E-Bill\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\n\nQR Ordering license active · JAMANVAAR QR · Valid through 12/11/2026. Your platform administrator manages licenses and device reassignment.\n\nQR Ordering\n\nGuests scan the code on their table, order from your menu, and the order reaches your counter and kitchen.\n\nEnabled\nOverview\nQR Orders\nService Requests\nMenu & Availability\nTables & QR\nCustomer Branding\nPayment Settings\nOrdering Rules\nAdvanced Features\nAnalytics\nNeeds attention today\n1 table without an active QR code — set up Tables & QR →\nMAKE EVERY TABLE FEEL WELCOME\nA better guest experience starts here.\n\nKeep your menu fresh, respond to guests and follow orders from the first scan to the last plate.\n\n1\nTables\n0\nActive QR codes\n0\nQR orders today\n₹0\nAccepted order value today\n0\nWaiting / in kitchen\n0\nCompleted\n0\nLanding sessions today\n₹0\nAverage order\nOrders by table today\nNo QR orders yet today.\nCounted by the server from real orders. Order value excludes unpaid online drafts and cancellations; paid sales include verified online payments and collected counter bills (₹0 so far).\nSet up guest ordering\n\nWork through the setup checks below, then open your live table QR to verify the guest experience.\n\n1. Publish menu\n2. Set up table QR\n3. Check payments\n4. Preview appearance\nShow advanced tools\nBefore your first guest\nYour branch setup checklist\nCheck setup again\n\nA setup check verifies configuration. Place a small test order and confirm staff receive it before opening service.\n\nSelected branch · 7/9 checks passed · Finish the checks below\n\nActive, correctly mapped QR codes\n\nGenerate a QR code for a valid table or menu in Tables & QR.\n\nOpen settings →\nOnline payment readinessOptional\n\nConfigure your merchant integration or turn off online payment.\n\nOpen settings →\nView completed checks (7)\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nRESTAURANT ADMIN\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
